title: "SELFGuard: Experimental post-generation behavioral-drift signals for prompt-injection detection"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - family-names: "Shayan"
repository-code: "https://github.com/shayanscripts/selfguard"
url: "https://github.com/shayanscripts/selfguard"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  An exploratory Python research preview for measuring behavioral drift in
  language-model responses and studying post-generation prompt-injection
  detection. The v0.1 evidence is limited to a SEP-derived fixed-system
  experiment and should not be interpreted as a production security guarantee.
keywords:
  - prompt injection
  - language models
  - AI safety
  - behavioral drift
